		{"id":"f4c9a32ea184ca42","type":"file","file":"AsherOCs/AccessibleDrawings/RandomPhidelComic/phidelmoic4.png","x":-1621,"y":99,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"2c71f5b0164c6924",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Characters mentioned:\n[[OCs/Minecraft/Phidel/|Phidel]], [[OCs/Minecraft/Adelyn/|Adelyn]], [[OCs/Minecraft/Leonard/|Leonard]]",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":"center",
				"shape":null,
				"border":"dotted"
			},
			"x":-1221,
			"y":-411,
			"width":280,
			"height":70,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{"id":"bff627e0ffef8aba","type":"file","file":"AsherOCs/AccessibleDrawings/RandomPhidelComic/phidelmoic1.png","x":-2301,"y":-301,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"9a42ec400117fd00","type":"file","file":"AsherOCs/AccessibleDrawings/RandomPhidelComic/phidelmoic2.png","x":-2301,"y":99,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"593b3da645ac01d1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- <h2><center>Transcript:</center></h2>\n- Adelyn: No ! You've got to believe me. They can understand us !\n- Leonard: Adelyn... Maybe you should get some rest.\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2660,
			"y":0,
			"width":300,
			"height":198
		},
		{
			"id":"931b8fc9e034bd3f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- <h2><center>Transcript:</center></h2>\n\n- Leonard: I don't know Adelyn. You haven't been sleeping and just keep on trying to talk ---\n- Adelyn: Leo, please. you've *got* to believe me.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1860,
			"y":-51,
			"width":221,
			"height":301
		},
		{"id":"333af8ac8923b63f","type":"file","file":"AsherOCs/AccessibleDrawings/RandomPhidelComic/phidelmoic6.png","x":-2221,"y":779,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"bf164c96941b4a5b","type":"file","file":"AsherOCs/AccessibleDrawings/RandomPhidelComic/phidelmoic7.png","x":-2021,"y":979,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"6269a874fa0aba86",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- <h2><center>Transcript:</center></h2>\n- Adelyn: And I have succeded.\n- Leonard: What?\n- Adelyn: And that one ? I call Phidel\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2340,
			"y":1200,
			"width":300,
			"height":179
		},
		{"id":"ea6c4f6ea5a5a045","type":"file","file":"AsherOCs/AccessibleDrawings/RandomPhidelComic/phidelmoic8.png","x":-1520,"y":599,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"bb8e8b5083c94399",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- <h2><center>Transcript:</center></h2>\n- Leonard: Is that it's name ?\n- Adelyn: No, I don't know if they name eachother.\n- Leonard: How do you even know which is which ?\n- Adelyn: Phidel usually comes closer, they have a specific pattern, tint, and are.. full of scratches.\n- Leonard: ... They all look the same to me. Also, wouldn't they have died by now ?\n- They're.. also a little smarter.\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1470,
			"y":979,
			"width":300,
			"height":400
		},
		{
			"id":"6c119c6a7564ba42",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- <h2><center>Transcript:</center></h2>\n- Adelyn: They hide under the foliage of the forests often. Which also leaves them with quite a few scratches.\n- ... And I mean many. Poor thing.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1160,
			"y":340,
			"width":300,
			"height":221
		},
		{
			"id":"4a2dfcf29bf430a1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- <h2><center>Transcript:</center></h2>\n- Adelyn: Phidel ! I told you, you don't need to be hiding and running around anymore. Just put a helmet on.\n- Phidel: Ok, I am sorry.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":20,
			"y":3,
			"width":300,
			"height":193
		},
		{
			"id":"7cbcfe54ec86a57b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Tags:\n#lazy #needstoberedone",
